            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148378,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>.map()</code> içine neden parametre olarak bir fonksiyon geçiririz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Her oyun değerini nasıl dönüştüreceğini <code>.map()</code> fonksiyonuna söylemek</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.map()</code> fonksiyonuna hangi diziyi dönüştüreceğini söylemek</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Çağıran dizide kaç öğe olduğunu <code>.map()</code> fonksiyonuna bildirmek</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Her oyun değerini nasıl dönüştüreceğini <code>.map()</code> fonksiyonuna söylemek.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148379,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Her oyuncunun can değerini (100 üzerinden) yüzdeye dönüştüren bir return ifadesi kodla.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"index\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"106\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"112\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health = [\" /><text value=\"95\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"60\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"75\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" healthPercent = health.map(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element / \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(healthPercent);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>return</code>, ardından <code>element</code> ve sonra <code>/</code>, <code>100</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148380,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>scores</code> dizisindeki her değere %10 bonus puan ekleyen bir arrow fonksiyonu kodla.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"65\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"86\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores = [\" /><text value=\"1200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"850\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"400\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2150\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" boosted = scores.map(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" score * \" /><text value=\"1.1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(boosted);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>scores</code>, ardından <code>map</code> ve sonra <code>score</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>&gt;</code>, <code>score * 1.1</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
