            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>loot</code> dizisinde <code>.filter()</code> fonksiyonunu çağırma söz dizimini tamamla.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"61\" endIndex=\"72\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" loot = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Torch&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Token&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Trap&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" T = loot.filter(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" (element[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] === \" /><text value=\"&quot;T&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"));\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(T);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>loot.filter</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148386,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>.filter()</code> kullanarak <code>bossDamage</code> dizisini doldurmak için satır içi fonksiyon bildirimini ve uygun parametreyi ekle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"100\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyDamage = [\" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"56\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"78\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"110\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"29\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"58\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bossDamage = enemyDamage.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"total\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total &gt; \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>function(total)</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148387,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parametreleri incele ve <code>first3</code>'ün ilk üç <code>spawnQueue</code> düşmanını depolayacağı söz dizimini tamamla.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"132\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" spawnQueue = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Orc&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" first3 = spawnQueue.filter(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"name, index\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" index &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(first3);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>index</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148388,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>.reduce()</code> içinde neden bir fonksiyonu parametre olarak geçiririz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Oyun değerlerini tek bir sonuçta nasıl birleştireceğini <code>.reduce()</code> fonksiyonuna söylemek</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>.reduce()</code> fonksiyonuna hangi diziyi değiştireceğini belirtmek için</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>.reduce()</code> fonksiyonuna hangi öğeleri tutacağını veya kaldıracağını belirtmek</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Oyun değerlerini tek bir sonuçta nasıl birleştireceğini <code>.reduce()</code> fonksiyonuna söylemek.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148389,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>coinPickups</code> dizisinde <code>.reduce()</code> fonksiyonunu çağırma söz dizimini tamamla.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"78\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" coinPickups = [\" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"21\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" totalCoins = coinPickups.reduce(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"prevVal, currVal\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" prevVal + currVal;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(totalCoins);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>coinPickups.reduce</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
